The root cause of the bug is the presence of unused and unnecessary member variables `nr_sorted` and `in_flight[]` in the `struct request_queue`, which were no longer utilized by any part of the code. This indicates that the code had remnants of a previous implementation that were not cleaned up, leading to potential confusion and maintenance issues.



